Fail-closed authority
---------------------
- specialized result must already be Promoted + Status.Promoted;
- at least two specialized evidence rounds and an existing specialized winner role are required;
- PromotedProfileId must identify the exact promoted profile;
- promoted profile must be Validated, exact target role and SourceComparisonId must identify the exact revalidation round;
- full upstream Custom Validated universal provenance is re-projected instead of trusting caller metadata;
- revalidation baseline/candidate must be Measured and environment-compatible;
- exact challenger/promoted Game, instance, CPU, RAM, renderer, FPS target, resolution and DPI must match the revalidation candidate;
- exact challenger/promoted environment fingerprint must match revalidation candidate environment id;
- promoted AverageFps, existing-evaluator OnePercentLow, FrameTimeMs and LatencyMs must match revalidation candidate evidence;
- wrong/unpromoted/incumbent-held id/role/evidence/config/fingerprint/metrics/revalidation/candidate/workload returns no projection;
- universal projection creates no challenge verdict, validation, winner, recommendation, mutation or persistence authority.

Critical challenge-context constraint
