The real Profile Challenge round compatibility path still captures PerformanceEvidenceSnapshot without PerformanceUniversalConfigurationContext. Slice 7's happy path explicitly verifies both challenge rounds have UniversalContext == null. No context was fabricated. Universal provenance is inherited only from the already-proven Custom Validated challenger. ProfileChallengeService, ProfileChallengeRoundService, ProfileChallengeEvaluator, freshness/incumbent logic and persistence remain unchanged.

